                        ],
                        "form": "конте́йнере"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "f16e8c1e-f774-4da4-994b-381232c68686",
                        "entry_id": "02dfc87f-c6ca-33ad-9b26-ab974606372b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "конте́йнерах"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fe7bb0b2-33d4-3967-9863-72c8aa666ccd",
                        "entry_id": "02dfc87f-c6ca-33ad-9b26-ab974606372b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "специально сконструированный сосуд или ящик для хранения и транспортировки определённых объектов"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c3e014e-91c4-41f3-9b62-35c9ad60d8ab",
                                "sense_id": "fe7bb0b2-33d4-3967-9863-72c8aa666ccd",
                                "text": "Контейнер с ядерными отходами."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c546410-3b5d-4a85-a077-dbb28d11c887",
                                "sense_id": "fe7bb0b2-33d4-3967-9863-72c8aa666ccd",
                                "text": "Как ему говорили, в подобных ситуациях тело укладывалось в герметичный контейнер и на любом уходящем с планеты корабле вывозилось далеко от системы и выбрасывалось в космос…"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "387e29a4-40bb-35d0-a18f-4442f9bc9935",
                        "entry_id": "02dfc87f-c6ca-33ad-9b26-ab974606372b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "стандартный ящик, предназначенный для перевозки грузов различными видами транспорта (автомобилями, железной дорогой, судами) и приспособленный для механизированной перегрузки с одного вида транспорта на другой (подъёмными кранами, штабелёрами и т. д.)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1980c35a-fde9-449f-8b1f-1f166e88aee5",
                                "sense_id": "387e29a4-40bb-35d0-a18f-4442f9bc9935",
                                "text": "Когда разберёшься, что к чему, возьмёшь в аренду контейнер, а может, сразу несколько и начнёшь самостоятельную торговлю!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "37eba65b-3f17-39c6-b339-639167683856",
                        "entry_id": "02dfc87f-c6ca-33ad-9b26-ab974606372b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "комп. файл, предназначенный для хранения данных разного вида (например, аудио и видео)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9722e2a-cae2-477c-874b-fadee4cad75a",
                                "sense_id": "37eba65b-3f17-39c6-b339-639167683856",
                                "text": "Собственно, сам документ — это один большой контейнер с именем «HTML»…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3b6d8658-bc60-4b62-a4cb-e179942baa3c",
                        "source_entry_id": "02dfc87f-c6ca-33ad-9b26-ab974606372b",
                        "target_lang_word": "container",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "container",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9b6160b2-ab31-3637-83f2-1096671aa691",
                                        "entry_id": "a284c2c8-0a51-30be-8f9d-13dfb5303a9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who contains; something that contains."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea297cdb-be47-3872-a6f1-c903949fedd2",
                                        "entry_id": "a284c2c8-0a51-30be-8f9d-13dfb5303a9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An item in which objects, materials or data can be stored or transported."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "777c043e-22c2-39f2-8fcc-afd130b25db2",
                                        "entry_id": "a284c2c8-0a51-30be-8f9d-13dfb5303a9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A very large, typically metal, box used for transporting goods."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "436a0a41-ff49-4b4e-9d18-48fb923fb83d",
                                                "sense_id": "777c043e-22c2-39f2-8fcc-afd130b25db2",
                                                "text": "Will container development merely bring about a substitution for the body of the covered wagon? Probably not, in his view, but he believes that the size and tonnage of the container are likely to increase pari passu with the lifting capacity of handling appliances."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8944d16-0d4e-41bb-85f9-c29de53cb602",
                                                "sense_id": "777c043e-22c2-39f2-8fcc-afd130b25db2",
                                                "text": "The specifiers of the Freightliner network had the foresight to base the rail journey on carrying ISO containers which are 8ft wide and originally 8ft tall (although now increased to a height of 9ft 6ins), with a variety of lengths."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "52922c10-fa33-30ec-b7be-48dd2185f118",
                                        "entry_id": "a284c2c8-0a51-30be-8f9d-13dfb5303a9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who holds people in their seats or in a (reasonably) calm state."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3f4861f4-dee4-39bc-b685-b64bbe4d07c5",
                                        "entry_id": "a284c2c8-0a51-30be-8f9d-13dfb5303a9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A file format that can hold various types of data."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "891bfb6f-fcf8-42e1-8d5b-783b6dce7c96",
                                                "sense_id": "3f4861f4-dee4-39bc-b685-b64bbe4d07c5",
                                                "text": "As the MP4 container can store audio, video, or both, the M4A naming and file extension is used to hint that this MP4 container holds solely audio information."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d738caa6-a813-3d76-9d45-4fffd23cf371",
                                        "entry_id": "a284c2c8-0a51-30be-8f9d-13dfb5303a9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An abstract data type whose instances are collections of other objects."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c004cc5a-a2cc-43e3-8d1c-3c6ee884d919",
                                                "sense_id": "d738caa6-a813-3d76-9d45-4fffd23cf371",
                                                "text": "This advantage is the primary incentive for using a list container, rather than a vector or a deque."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e554182-b5a9-3ac6-a6ae-88f638d85bb5",
                                        "entry_id": "a284c2c8-0a51-30be-8f9d-13dfb5303a9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any user interface component that can hold further (child) components."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83d69fc1-8c8b-4eef-a6c9-123448d7ad94",
                                                "sense_id": "3e554182-b5a9-3ac6-a6ae-88f638d85bb5",
                                                "text": "Flex automatically creates a TabBar container at the top of the TabNavigator container, with a tab corresponding to each child container. Each tab can have its own label and icon."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0b76df7-fe21-3912-ac24-c8c6f87c8056",
                                        "entry_id": "a284c2c8-0a51-30be-8f9d-13dfb5303a9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A web container."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "16427390-e72f-3ac5-ba6e-53d1dc4e9622",
                                        "entry_id": "a284c2c8-0a51-30be-8f9d-13dfb5303a9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A bundle consisting of operating system, application code and dependencies to be run sandboxed inside a virtualized environment; (by extension) the environment itself."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "06171d16-99ef-4021-883c-e296cf07049a",
                                                "sense_id": "16427390-e72f-3ac5-ba6e-53d1dc4e9622",
                                                "text": "Generally, when people think of serverless computing, they tend to think of applications with back-ends that run on third-party services, also described as code running on ephemeral containers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2298e13d-3ed1-465e-81ac-2e5eae914b01",
                                                "sense_id": "16427390-e72f-3ac5-ba6e-53d1dc4e9622",
                                                "text": "The application components all run in containers. They are isolated like VMs but lightweight and efficient like PaaS services."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2a7b39f-ecc1-3c67-980b-b71161d377d9",
                                        "entry_id": "a284c2c8-0a51-30be-8f9d-13dfb5303a9c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A type of cryptic device where one word is inserted into another."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c76f4347-5f72-4c75-8a28-c72b1952e86e",
                                                "sense_id": "a2a7b39f-ecc1-3c67-980b-b71161d377d9",
                                                "text": "As with all varieties of cryptic clues, the container device can be used in conjunction with other devices, especially in more complex cryptic crosswords."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19de2df6-4012-46fe-bea7-11e009b7a16d",
                                                "sense_id": "a2a7b39f-ecc1-3c67-980b-b71161d377d9",
                                                "text": "Container word clues are actually three clues in one."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e874def7-65ef-40b3-a89a-086cd6ceca03",
                                                "sense_id": "a2a7b39f-ecc1-3c67-980b-b71161d377d9",
                                                "text": "We have already mentioned 'in' having multiple uses; 'round' or 'around' might be a container indicator or a reversal indicator; 'without' might be a container indicator or a deletion indicator, and so on."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6a5a0530-75df-49bc-be76-6b8f8809dcc0",
                        "source_entry_id": "02dfc87f-c6ca-33ad-9b26-ab974606372b",
                        "target_lang_word": "Container",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Container",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "18667335-66e4-3a2e-8092-fffbde5d7886",
                                        "entry_id": "8f3419af-f17f-3a5d-a311-2304efbfdc2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein spezieller, genormter Transportbehälter für den Güterfernverkehr"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51ce72a6-736d-40b0-832a-dabd9ebcd359",
                                                "sense_id": "18667335-66e4-3a2e-8092-fffbde5d7886",
                                                "text": "Als wir nach Kanada ausgewandert sind, haben wir alle unsere Möbel und Bücher in einen Container gepackt und per Schiff über den Atlantik geschickt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e541190-9bc6-462d-9f86-bb96745c5558",
                                                "sense_id": "18667335-66e4-3a2e-8092-fffbde5d7886",
                                                "text": "„Vor genau 40 Jahren hat die Geschichte des Containerverkehrs in Deutschland begonnen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5fe7b10-649b-4ddd-b539-49c8f8163e34",
                                                "sense_id": "18667335-66e4-3a2e-8092-fffbde5d7886",
                                                "text": "„Manche Container waren in Wohnbereiche für zwei oder drei Familien aufgeteilt, an den Seiten waren mit dem Schneidbrenner grobe Öffnungen als Türen und Fenster hineingeschnitten worden.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ab325a5-04f6-4ba0-a3eb-f1efb64e4a4e",
                                                "sense_id": "18667335-66e4-3a2e-8092-fffbde5d7886",
                                                "text": "„Fast 500 Schiffe mussten für Tage ihre Fahrt unterbrechen, und als die Sperrung eines der zentralen Verkehrswege Europas aufgehoben wurde, blieben noch immer drei Container vermisst."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "737c8847-b8bc-454e-bec1-cd7ded601145",
                                                "sense_id": "18667335-66e4-3a2e-8092-fffbde5d7886",
                                                "text": "„Ich sah den Container vom Motorboot aus, ein quadratisches Panzerschiff, grau und breit.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a2246de8-99ca-31ce-89c2-becec47c30d6",
                                        "entry_id": "8f3419af-f17f-3a5d-a311-2304efbfdc2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein (meist großer) Behälter"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "general"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e997f48b-709e-4890-80c9-6b96012a4838",
                                                "sense_id": "a2246de8-99ca-31ce-89c2-becec47c30d6",
                                                "text": "„In welchen Container kommen blaue und orangene Flaschen?“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bdee3e7d-cc1c-34c1-afea-020465fae953",
                                        "entry_id": "8f3419af-f17f-3a5d-a311-2304efbfdc2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "transportabler, gleichwohl absetzbarer Behälter vor allem für Bauschutt (Mulde)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f819604c-16b6-497a-9529-9afc6d13245e",
                                                "sense_id": "bdee3e7d-cc1c-34c1-afea-020465fae953",
                                                "text": "„Für Entrümpelungen, Umbauarbeiten, Grünabfälle oder andere Abfälle bieten wir Ihnen Container in unterschiedlichen Größen an.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13cf42ed-b4c5-4951-9db4-bee11e73f1b3",
                                                "sense_id": "bdee3e7d-cc1c-34c1-afea-020465fae953",
                                                "text": "Der Container, den wir für unseren Bauschutt gemietet haben, versperrt unsere Einfahrt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c1d594bb-e5ce-4f78-9c64-c6c5c3242975",
                                                "sense_id": "bdee3e7d-cc1c-34c1-afea-020465fae953",
                                                "text": "„Ich hatte für den nächsten Tag einen Container bestellt, hatte gedacht, ich könnte das meiste hineinwerfen, es sofort wegschaffen lassen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"3\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "word_linkages": [
